{"id":"8670ef2cc176069b","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set.md","title":"ZFC Hereditarily Kappa Set","display":"df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set — ZFC Hereditarily Kappa Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set"],"display":"df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set — ZFC Hereditarily Kappa Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-transitive-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set — ZFC Hereditarily Kappa Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"58-df-transitive-closure\">58-df-transitive-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}\\)</span> (transitive-closure operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"58-df-transitive-closure\">58-df-transitive-closure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S(x,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})|&lt;\\kappa\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S(x,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})|&lt;\\kappa\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Using the transitive closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{x\\}\">\\(\\{x\\}\\)</span> makes the convention independent of whether the transitive-closure operator itself includes its argument.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-closure","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (cardinal, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-closure","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TC}$ (transitive-closure operator, see [[58-df-transitive-closure]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S(x,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})|<\\kappa","display":true},{"tex":"\\{x\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1029,"backlinks":[{"id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S$ (遗传大小谓词, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set.md]])"},{"id":"239d08888e8a2799","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2263","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set.md|58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set]]（batch12）"